
Fact party Identified by String

Placeholder provider For party
Placeholder compute-provider For party
Placeholder consumer For party
Placeholder reviewer For party

Fact asset Identified by String
Placeholder resource For asset

Fact purpose Identified by String
Placeholder intended-purpose For purpose

Fact session Identified by String
Placeholder job For session

Fact controls
    Identified by provider * resource

Fact accepted-terms
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact authorised-purpose
    Identified by provider * resource * intended-purpose

Fact session-purpose
    Identified by job * intended-purpose


Fact admission-approved
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job

Fact admitted
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job

Fact admission-prerequisites-met
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job
    Holds when controls(provider, resource)
        && accepted-terms(compute-provider, resource, job)
        && session-purpose(job, intended-purpose)
        && authorised-purpose(provider, resource, intended-purpose)

Act approve-admission
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates admission-approved(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when controls(provider, resource)
        && admission-prerequisites-met(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)

Act request-access
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when admission-prerequisites-met(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && admission-approved(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)


Duty deletion-evidence-duty
    Holder compute-provider
    Claimant provider
    Related to resource, job

Fact deletion-evidence-submitted
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-evidence-accepted
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-deadline-expired
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-deadline-breached
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Act close-job
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
    Terminates admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act submit-evidence
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-submitted(
        compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)

Act accept-evidence
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-accepted(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
    Terminates deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-evidence-submitted(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act assess-deadline
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-deadline-breached(
        compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-deadline-expired(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && !deletion-evidence-accepted(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)


Fact reviewer-assigned
    Identified by provider * reviewer * resource

Fact observation-reported
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact finding-recorded
    Identified by reviewer * compute-provider * resource * job

Fact human-response-authorised
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * job

Act report-observation
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates observation-reported(
        compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act record-finding
    Actor reviewer
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to provider, resource, job
    Creates finding-recorded(
        reviewer, compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when reviewer-assigned(
        provider, reviewer, resource)
        && observation-reported(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act accept-deletion
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to reviewer, resource, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-accepted(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
    Terminates deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
    Holds when finding-recorded(
        reviewer, compute-provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-evidence-submitted(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-evidence-duty(
            compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act authorise-response
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to reviewer, resource, job
    Creates human-response-authorised(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when finding-recorded(
        reviewer, compute-provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-deadline-breached(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-evidence-duty(
            compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)
